    "background_story": "Carson was a skilled and compassionate doctor who specialized in treating wounds and infections. He worked tirelessly in a busy emergency room, often encountering patients with severe suppurative wounds that required immediate attention. Despite the challenges, Carson approached each case with precision and care, using his expertise to clean and dress the wounds, and administering antibiotics to combat the underlying infections. His dedication and expertise earned him the respect of his colleagues and the gratitude of his patients. One particularly memorable case was a young boy who had suffered a severe burn injury. Carson's swift and skilled treatment helped to prevent further infection, and the boy made a full recovery. Carson's work was a testament to the importance of meticulous care in healing even the most suppurative of wounds.",
